{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:16SimulationModule0A0V","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Simulation","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Simulation"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Simulation.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SimulationModule\/Simulation.swift#L59"},"title":"Simulation","symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"SimulationModule"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/Simulation","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A world and its schedules by label, advanced one frame at a time."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Creating-a-Simulation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/Simulation\/init(_:fixedTimestep:maximumDelta:)","doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/Simulation\/init(_:checkedFixedTimestep:maximumDelta:)"],"title":"Creating a Simulation"},{"anchor":"Adding-Systems-and-States","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/Simulation\/add(to:_:)","doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/Simulation\/add(state:)"],"title":"Adding Systems and States"},{"anchor":"Running-Frames","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/Simulation\/update(elapsed:)","doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/Simulation\/run(_:)","doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/Simulation\/maximumDelta"],"title":"Running Frames"},{"anchor":"Inspecting-a-Simulation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/Simulation\/world","doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/Simulation\/schedules"],"title":"Ins